                                                padding-left:10px"><img src="./img/aerrow.png" 
                                                class="img img-fluid"><b>Automated transfer execution and manual transfer trigger:</b>
                                                </span>
                                                <p style="padding-left: 20px;">Enables both scheduled automatic execution and user-driven manual stock replenishment.</p>
