                                        </div>           

                                        <div class="container position-relative " style="">
                                            <div style="display:inline">
                                                <span style="font-size:22px;  color:#212529; 
                                                text-transform:capitalize; font-family:Montserrat;
                                                padding-left:10px"><img src="./img/aerrow.png" 
                                                class="img img-fluid"><b>Inventory analysis reports:</b>
                                                </span>
                                                <p style="padding-left: 20px;">Generates reports to analyze stock behavior such as fast-moving, slow-moving, overstock and deadstock items.</p>
                                            </div>
