                                    <img src="./img/aerrow.png" class="img img-fluid">Create a product launch by entering the title, selecting the offer type as Product Launch, setting the launch date, and adding a description. Add customer tags to target who will receive the notification, and optionally set a custom notification date to automatically send WhatsApp messages to all tagged customers.
