                                    <img src="./img/aerrow.png" class="img img-fluid">We also provide Abandoned Cart notifications. From Configuration > Settings, you have to enter the number of hours after which a notification for the abandoned cart will be sent to the customer. If the cart remains without any action for the configured number of hours, the system automatically sends a WhatsApp notification to the customer, and the reminder interval can be configured from the Settings.

