                                     <div class="fullrow shadow" style="padding: 16px;border-radius: 
                                        10px;margin-bottom: 20px;">
                                        <span><img src="./img/right-aerrow.png" class="img img-fluid" 
                                            style="margin-right: 12px; width: 3%;"></span><span style="
                                            font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;">Can I generate forecasts warehouse and company-wise?</span>
                                        <ul style="margin-top: 10px;">
                                            <li>Yes, the system allows forecasting based on warehosue and company.</li>
                                        </ul>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="fullrow shadow" style="padding: 16px;border-radius: 
                                        10px;margin-bottom: 20px;">
                                        <span><img src="./img/right-aerrow.png" class="img img-fluid" 
                                            style="margin-right: 12px; width: 3%;"></span><span style="
                                            font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;">Can I use multiple source warehouses for internal transfer?</span>
                                        <ul style="margin-top: 10px;">
                                            <li>Yes, the system supports multiple source warehouses with priority-based allocation.</li>
                                        </ul>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="fullrow shadow" style="padding: 16px;border-radius: 
                                        10px;margin-bottom: 20px;">
                                        <span><img src="./img/right-aerrow.png" class="img img-fluid" 
                                            style="margin-right: 12px; width: 3%;"></span><span style="
                                            font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;">What reports are available?</span>
                                        <ul style="margin-top: 10px;">
                                            <li>Module includes multiple reports such as Deadstock, Fast Moving, Excess Stock, and Days of Inventory reports.</li>
                                        </ul>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="fullrow shadow" style="padding: 16px;border-radius: 
                                        10px;margin-bottom: 20px;">
                                        <span><img src="./img/right-aerrow.png" class="img img-fluid" 
                                            style="margin-right: 12px; width: 3%;"></span><span style="
                                            font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;">Can I adjust forecasts for seasonal demand changes?</span>
                                        <ul style="margin-top: 10px;">
                                            <li>Yes, seasonality rules with monthly factors allow you to fine-tune forecasts based on your business patterns.</li>
                                        </ul>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="fullrow shadow" style="padding: 16px;border-radius: 
                                        10px;margin-bottom: 20px;">
                                        <span><img src="./img/right-aerrow.png" class="img img-fluid" 
                                            style="margin-right: 12px; width: 3%;"></span><span style="
                                            font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;">What happens if stock is not available in source warehouses?</span>
                                        <ul style="margin-top: 10px;">
                                            <li>The system first tries internal transfers based on priority, and if demand is still unmet, it automatically suggests a purchase order.</li>
                                        </ul>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="fullrow shadow" style="padding: 16px;border-radius: 
                                        10px;margin-bottom: 20px;">
                                        <span><img src="./img/right-aerrow.png" class="img img-fluid" 
                                            style="margin-right: 12px; width: 3%;"></span><span style="
                                            font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;">Can I view the status of transfers?</span>
                                        <ul style="margin-top: 10px;">
                                            <li>Yes, logs provide clear status for each product, showing whether the transfer or purchase order was successfully created or failed.</li>
                                        </ul>
                                    </div>                                                                                              
                                    
                                    <div class="fullrow shadow" style="padding: 16px;border-radius: 
                                        10px;margin-bottom: 20px;">
                                        <span><img src="./img/right-aerrow.png" class="img img-fluid" 
                                            style="margin-right: 12px; width: 3%;"></span><span style="
                                            font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;">I would like to request a custom feature for this application. What’s the process to get it implemented?</span>
                                        <ul style="margin-top: 10px;">
